- The length of the integer array parameter `nums` is less than or equal to 100000 and is greater than or equal to 1.
- All the values in the integer array parameter `nums` are less than or equal to 1000000000 and are greater than or equal to -1000000000.
- The boolean result is true if any value in the integer array parameter `nums` appears at least twice.
- The boolean result is false if every element in the integer array parameter `nums` is distinct.